 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "RHS・品種: 春に枯れ葉と古い花茎を除く。Walters・品種: 晩冬に刈る。MBG の「花後」は穂の色の説明で剪定の話ではなく、おぎはら楽天は決まった文。機械の B は取り違え（同じ種の他品種と同じ A）",
  "management_type_quote": "Trim back in late winter.",
  "management_type_by_matching": "B 花後刈込型",
  "heat_west_only": "弱",
  "muggy_west_only": null,
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；強\n[MBG/種] Decreased flowering may also occur in hot summer climates.\n[NC State/種] Performs best in cool summer climates.\n[NC State/種] Does not perform well in hot summer climates.\n[食い違い] 欧米の文献（種の記述）は 弱 相当。おぎはら植物園の値を採った\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: South-facing or North-facing or East-facing or West-facing",
